# No native browser dialogs

**Hard rule for all Playgrounds UI/UX** (field shell, Platform dash, docs chrome, SAM surfaces, any in-app UI):

- **Do not** use `window.alert`, `window.confirm`, or `window.prompt` (or equivalents) to confirm actions or collect text from the user.
- **Do** use in-app UI: custom confirm panels／modals, inline forms, toast／flash status, dedicated pages.
- Destructive actions still need an explicit confirm step — implement it in the page chrome, with keyboard focus and cancel.

Exceptions: none for product UI. Devtools-only scripts outside the shipped UI are out of scope.
